  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and sauté until it turns golden brown.",
    "Add the grated ginger and minced garlic and sauté for another minute.",
    "Add the cumin powder, coriander powder, turmeric powder, and red chili powder. Mix well.",
    "Add the marinated chicken and cook until it is browned on all sides.",
    "Add 2 cups of water to the pan and bring to a boil.",
